---
template_name: "conan-profile"
description: "Conan profile generation for embedded and cross-compilation"
category: "conan"
variables:
  profile_name: "esp32s3"
  os_name: "baremetal"
  arch: "xtensa"
  compiler: "gcc"
  compiler_version: "11"
  build_type: "Release"
  cppstd: "20"
---
# Conan Profile: {{ profile_name }}

## Profile Configuration

```ini
[settings]
os={{ os_name }}
arch={{ arch }}
compiler={{ compiler }}
compiler.version={{ compiler_version }}
build_type={{ build_type }}
compiler.cppstd={{ cppstd }}
{% if libcxx %}compiler.libcxx={{ libcxx }}{% endif %}

[options]
*:fPIC=True

[buildenv]
{% if idf_target %}IDF_TARGET={{ idf_target }}{% endif %}
{% if idf_path %}IDF_PATH={{ idf_path }}{% endif %}

[tool_requires]
sparetools-cpython/3.12.7
```

## Usage

### Save Profile
```bash
# Create profile directory
mkdir -p conan-profiles

# Save profile
cat > conan-profiles/{{ profile_name }}.profile << 'EOF'
[settings]
os={{ os_name }}
arch={{ arch }}
compiler={{ compiler }}
compiler.version={{ compiler_version }}
build_type={{ build_type }}
compiler.cppstd={{ cppstd }}

[options]
*:fPIC=True

[buildenv]
{% if idf_target %}IDF_TARGET={{ idf_target }}{% endif %}
EOF
```

### Use Profile
```bash
# Install with profile
conan install . --profile:host=conan-profiles/{{ profile_name }}.profile --build=missing

# Build with profile
conan build . --profile:host=conan-profiles/{{ profile_name }}.profile
```

## Platform-Specific Notes

{% if arch == "xtensa" %}
### ESP32 (Xtensa)
- Requires ESP-IDF toolchain
- Use `IDF_TARGET` environment variable
- JTAG debugging available on ESP32-S3
{% elif arch == "avr" %}
### Arduino (AVR)
- Requires avr-gcc toolchain
- Use avrdude for flashing
- Limited to C++11
{% elif arch == "riscv32" %}
### ESP32-C3/C6 (RISC-V)
- Requires RISC-V toolchain from ESP-IDF
- Native USB support on C3/C6
{% endif %}
